1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,600
I'm your China Travel Expert.
我是你的中国旅游专家

2
00:00:01,600 --> 00:00:04,000
A mulberry tree bloomed white lotus.
一棵桑树·开出白莲

3
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:06,300
So they built a temple around it.
于是·围它建了座寺

4
00:00:06,300 --> 00:00:08,600
Quanzhou's Kaiyuan Temple, founded 686.
泉州开元寺·始建686年

5
00:00:08,600 --> 00:00:11,000
That mulberry still stands — 1,300 years old.
那棵桑树还在·1300岁

6
00:00:11,000 --> 00:00:13,400
Two Song-era stone pagodas guard it.
两座宋代石塔·守着它

7
00:00:13,400 --> 00:00:15,800
In 1604 a magnitude-8 quake struck.
1604年·约8级大地震

8
00:00:15,800 --> 00:00:18,200
The stone towers never fell.
石塔·纹丝没倒

9
00:00:18,200 --> 00:00:20,600
Locals still greet in Minnan: 食饱未?
本地人闽南话问候·食饱未？

10
00:00:20,600 --> 00:00:23,300
★ Expert Tip: Circle the East Pagoda to read its stone-carved figures.
内行提示：绕东塔一圈·细看塔身佛雕

11
00:00:23,300 --> 00:00:26,000
Follow — I'll take you to the next city.
关注·带你去下一座城
